1
00:00:00,735 --> 00:00:03,735
(Penny:)Maybe if you're working on a tuna boat.

2
00:00:04,239 --> 00:00:06,579
- Hello, Penny.
- Sheldon, here is your money.

3
00:00:06,741 --> 00:00:08,701
(Penny:)Thank you very much, it helped a lot.

4
00:00:09,327 --> 00:00:11,167
(Sheldon:)Sarcasm?

5
00:00:11,913 --> 00:00:13,123
(Sheldon:)- No.
- Darn.

6
00:00:13,290 --> 00:00:15,620
(Sheldon:)I can't seem to get the hang of that.

7
00:00:16,626 --> 00:00:20,216
(Leonard:)Hey, I know it's none of my business,
but where did the money come from?

8
00:00:20,380 --> 00:00:22,460
(Penny:)Well, I cut back my expenses
like you said...

9
00:00:22,632 --> 00:00:24,762
...and picked up more hours
at the restaurant.

10
00:00:24,926 --> 00:00:27,596
(Penny:)The biggest thing was, out of the blue,
Kurt shows up...

11
00:00:27,762 --> 00:00:29,432
(Penny:)...and gives me the money he owes me.

12
00:00:29,598 --> 00:00:30,638
[PENNY CHUCKLES]

13
00:00:30,807 --> 00:00:31,887
(Penny:)Really?

14
00:00:32,058 --> 00:00:34,308
(Leonard:)Did he say why?

15
00:00:34,477 --> 00:00:38,567
(Penny:)Yes. He said he was feeling guilty
and wanted to do what was right.

16
00:00:39,774 --> 00:00:41,564
[PENNY CHUCKLES]

17
00:00:41,735 --> 00:00:43,405
(Leonard:)That's it?

18
00:00:44,738 --> 00:00:49,658
(Leonard:)Did he give any reason
as to why he came to this moral epiphany?

19
00:00:50,160 --> 00:00:53,330
(Penny:)Nope. I just think he's really changed.

20
00:00:55,790 --> 00:00:59,020
(Penny:)We're having dinner tomorrow night.
And I get to wear my new beret. Ha, ha.

